  (text "DISPLAY: 3.5 in IPS 320x480 driven as RGB565 from the MCU's LTDC, with SPI for controller set-up.\n!! J7 and J8 PIN ORDER IS A PLACEHOLDER. No panel datasheet could be opened. The signal SET is complete; the ORDER must be\n   re-mapped to the purchased panel's FPC pinout (and connector pin count / top-bottom contact) before layout.\n   Unused low-order colour bits and interface-select (IM) straps are panel-specific and not shown.\nBACKLIGHT: TPS61165 boost assumes the panel's LEDs are one SERIES string (R46 = 200 mV / I_LED -> 20 mA). If the panel's LEDs\n   are in parallel this circuit is wrong and is replaced by a low-side PWM switch. Values from memory - confirm."
    (at 20 15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid 4cf9142b-c111-536e-b222-25a33c9d7a7f)
  )
